:fill_in_blank[6].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"雖然考試不容易，但(　)，只要努力學習，就有機會取得好成績。","n":30,"ssz":".............................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[7].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"面對別人的失誤，我們應該多一些理解，少一些 (　)。","n":26,"ssz":".............2.....2......"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列選項中，哪個句子中的詞語使用不正確？","n":20,"ssz":".......1.1......1..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小明看到同學摔倒，「自告奮勇」的上前幫忙，十分熱心","n":25,"ssz":".......1................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"只要我們努力準備，相信「事在人為」，一定會有好結果的","n":26,"ssz":".........1........1......."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"如果火災發生時，消防隊來不及救援，後果將「不堪設想」","n":26,"ssz":".........................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"她們倆的交情「情有可原」，兩人從國小時期就是好朋友","n":25,"ssz":"........................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文章提到二審法官判定陳同學也需賠償顏家，何者是法官做出此判決的原因？(第六段，二審法官的理由)","n":47,"ssz":"..............................................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"法官認為陳同學雖是好心，也要考量自身能力","n":20,"ssz":"...............1...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"法官認為陳同學已經發揮照顧同學的美德，情有可原","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"法官認為陳同學沒有提供無障礙設施給顏同學","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"法官認為家屬的延誤就醫是導致顏同學死亡的主因","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"緒恩舉手發問機車騎士扶老爺爺事件時，越說越激動，請你推測一下，讓緒恩情緒激動的背後原因是什麼？","n":47,"ssz":".............1..............1.................."},{"section":"served